QA N1. A deferred closure wraps a nil named result with fmt.Errorf("%w"):
the result is an error that wraps nothing, an Opaque Error, listed once and
plain (QA4 m3: not again under its own fmt.Errorf).
-- args --
a.go:@q
-- stdout --
